    "description": "Publish a new version of a doc or regenerate a brain wiki you own: queues a paid run and returns run_id; poll runs_get. Cap spend with max_credits. Or set the manifest of an artifact you own (type manifest): the title, summary, description, compatibility and known limitations its listings show, free and at once. Type private with org makes it visible only to that org's members, one way. Idempotency key optional: _meta contextfile/idempotency_key. Examples: {\"type\":\"doc\",\"artifact_id\":\"<artifact_id>\",\"brief\":\"Cover the v3 API\"}; {\"type\":\"brain_wiki\",\"artifact_id\":\"<artifact_id>\",\"max_credits\":3}; {\"type\":\"manifest\",\"artifact_id\":\"<artifact_id>\",\"manifest\":{\"title\":\"Stripe webhook upgrade guide\",\"summary\":\"Retries, idempotency and signature checks for Stripe webhooks.\"}}; {\"type\":\"private\",\"artifact_id\":\"<artifact_id>\",\"org\":\"org_2x7k9m\"}",
